## Recorded with gifterm rec, then hand-edited:
##   - `npm run gt -- rec clone.gt --cols 60 --rows 12`
##
## Check it like this:
##   - `npm run gt -- check clone.gt
##
## Convert it to mp4 like this:
##   - `npm run gt -- render clone.gt -o clone.mp4

#cols 80
#rows 10
#char-speed 40ms
#line-speed 10ms
#raw-speed 10ms

P ~ $ 
D 80
C cd Desktop
D 80
N
P ~/Desktop $ 
D 80
C git clone git@github.com:my-username/my-jetlag-tutorials.git
D 80
N
